        },
        "summary_en": {
          "motivation": "Investigate the combined effects of build position and machining on the fatigue strength of Ti-6Al-4V parts fabricated by electron beam melting.",
          "method": "Fatigue tests were conducted on specimens taken from different build heights and with as-built or machined surfaces.",
          "result": "Machining significantly improved fatigue strength, with build position effects linked to defect distribution.",
          "validation": "Experimental fatigue testing and fractographic analysis were used to validate the findings."
        },
